## Fleet ship hull overlapped sand on sloped shore
- Date: 2026-11-03
- What went wrong: fleet ships clamped to water using shore() at the ship's centre x only; their ~40px half-length hull reached over the sand where the shore rises on the right.
- Root cause: copied the original cruise clamp (centre sample) for ships that get close to the shoreline.
- Fix: clamp y with the highest shore point sampled at x-40, x, x+40 (margin 21).
- How to avoid: when a wide sprite follows a sloped boundary, sample the boundary across the sprite's full extent, not just its anchor.
- Repeat count: 1
